# Office UI events

If `.aisdlc/` exists, emit on every agent turn start/end.

```bash
python3 .cursor/scripts/office-event.py \
  --agent <agent-id> \
  --status working|waiting|done|error|idle \
  --task "<short task>" \
  --phase <phase> \
  --workflow <module-or-workflow-id> \
  [--tokens N] [--tokens-in N] [--tokens-out N]
```

## Token audit (required on `done` when known)

When finishing a turn / phase, if you can estimate or read usage:

```bash
python3 .cursor/scripts/office-event.py \
  --agent backend-worker \
  --status done \
  --task "API done" \
  --phase implement-backend \
  --workflow {feature_name} \
  --tokens 25000 \
  --tokens-in 19000 \
  --tokens-out 6000
```

- `--workflow` groups costs for the TOKEN AUDIT panel (per module).
- Tokens accumulate in `.aisdlc/state.json` and `.aisdlc/benchmarks.json`.
- Prefer real usage meters when the host exposes them; otherwise estimate and label in `--detail` as `est`.

## Status

| Status | When |
|--------|------|
| `working` | Start task |
| `waiting` | Blocked |
| `done` | Success (+ tokens when possible) |
| `error` | Failed |
| `idle` | Clear desk |

UI: `ai-sdlc ui` → http://127.0.0.1:9669 — click a desk to inspect task + tokens; LIVE BOARD updates **in place** per agent.
